{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0045026 plasma membrane fusion GO:0032220 plasma membrane fusion involved in cytogamy\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31270\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Irk4Is07A3EBM40cDrJ3HUEOBlJeTl7_G3oqLKAMBUQ/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \n  1 MGI @LiNiMGI \n   6 PomBase @ValWood \n   2 SGD @suzialeksander \n   1 TAIR @lreiser \n  12 UniProt @Antonialock \n   2 WB @vanaukenk \n\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: \n\nGO:0045026 | hamap2go | HAMAP:MF_00869 > GO:plasma membrane fusion\nGO:0045026 | unirule2go | UniRule:UR001792677 > GO:plasma membrane fusion \n\nconsider cell-cell fusion or cytogamy\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-01-20T14:49:10Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to obsolete GO:0045026 plasma membrane fusion GO:0032220 plasma membrane fusion involved in cytogamy", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-02-09T16:47:20Z"}
